{"id":"bid-pool","title":"The same firms, list after list","question":"Is City street and civil work bid by a small, stable group of firms, and do the wins rotate?","finding":"Six firms (R&S Construction Management, Inc., Mitchell Engineering, Precision Engineering, Inc., Esquivel Grading & Paving, Inc., A. Ruiz Construction Company, Ronan Construction, Inc.) account for 132 of the 420 bids; at least two of them meet on 32 of 71 Public Works lists, and one of the six is recommended on 21 of those. Esquivel Grading & Paving, Inc. was recommended on 10 of the 22 lists it entered; R&S Construction Management, Inc. on 3 of 27.","how":"Bidder names are standardised (spelling variants merged), then counted: lists entered, times recommended for award, times lowest, and the rival met most often.","limits":"The sample is small: 108 bid lists (71 Public Works 2022–26, 15 Port, 22 Muni), only contracts large enough to go to a commission with the tabulation attached. The airport and the water department publish none without a login. A small pool is expected: few firms hold the licences, bonding and local-business certification for City paving and curb-ramp work, and a firm that bids often wins often. The published sheets do not list subcontractors, so whether a losing bidder then works under the winner cannot be seen here. Nothing in this table shows agreement between firms.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"firm","t":"Firm","type":"org"},{"k":"agency","t":"Mostly bids at","type":"text"},{"k":"entered","t":"Lists entered","type":"int"},{"k":"lowest","t":"Lowest price","type":"int"},{"k":"recommended","t":"Recommended","type":"int"},{"k":"winShare","t":"Recommended share","type":"pct"},{"k":"rival","t":"Meets most often","type":"org"},{"k":"met","t":"Times","type":"int"}],"rows":[{"firm":"R&S Construction Management, Inc.","entered":27,"recommended":3,"lowest":3,"winShare":0.111,"rival":"Esquivel Grading & Paving, Inc.","met":17,"agency":"Public Works"},{"firm":"Mitchell Engine